  "title": "Ham Bone and Bean Soup",
  "description": "This ham bone and bean soup recipe makes use of leftover ham! The result is a comforting, gluten-free soup that comes together quickly with soaked beans.",
  "authors": [
    "Rick Kleinhans kokodiablo"
